# Auth & Shop State

## Login gate
- `src/proxy.ts` sends visitors without a session to `/welcome`
- A session on `/welcome`, `/login`, `/register`, or `/otp` redirects to `/`
- Matcher skips `api`, `_next`, `products`, and files with an extension

## OTP
- `POST /api/auth/otp/request` with `{ phone, name? }`. Phone must match `09` + 9 digits (`src/lib/phone.ts`)
- Stores `plenty_otp_phone` and optional `plenty_otp_name` for 10 minutes
- `POST /api/auth/otp/verify` with `{ code }`. Demo code is `1234` (`OTP_CODE`)
- Success sets httpOnly `plenty_session` for 14 days: JSON `{ name, phone }`
- Login without a name uses «کاربر پلنتی»
- `POST /api/auth/logout` clears the session. The account screen also clears `plenty-shop`

## Do not
- Put the session in `localStorage` or call `Buffer` inside the proxy
- Add NextAuth, refresh tokens, or a remote API unless asked
- Change the demo code or cookie names without updating both the routes and `src/lib/session.ts`

## Orders
- `placeOrder` writes to `plenty-shop` and clears the cart
- New orders start as `waiting_courier` (در انتظار پیک), id `KH-#####`
